@startuml C4_Sequence_Message_Flow
title Sequence Diagram - Device Message Flow

actor "管理员" as user
participant "Web应用\n(Vue 3)" as web_app
participant "API服务\n(FastAPI)" as api
participant "MQTT Bridge\n(Python)" as mqtt_bridge
participant "MQTT Broker\n(EMQX/Mosquitto)" as mqtt_broker
participant "IoT设备\n(ESP8266)" as device
database "数据库\n(PostgreSQL)" as database
database "缓存\n(Redis)" as cache

== 设备注册流程 ==
user -> web_app: 注册设备
web_app -> api: POST /devices
api -> database: 保存设备信息
api -> api: 生成设备证书
api -> database: 保存证书信息
api -> web_app: 返回设备信息
web_app -> user: 显示设备信息

== 设备连接流程 ==
device -> mqtt_broker: MQTT Connect (TLS 1.3)
mqtt_broker -> mqtt_broker: 验证设备证书
mqtt_broker -> device: Connection ACK
device -> mqtt_broker: Subscribe to control topic
mqtt_broker -> device: Subscribe ACK

== 设备消息发布流程 ==
device -> mqtt_broker: Publish sensor data (MQTT over TLS)
mqtt_broker -> mqtt_bridge: 转发消息
mqtt_bridge -> api: 处理消息
api -> database: 存储传感器数据
api -> cache: 更新设备状态
api -> mqtt_bridge: 响应处理结果

== 设备控制流程 ==
user -> web_app: 发送控制命令
web_app -> api: POST /devices/{id}/control
api -> database: 验证设备权限
api -> mqtt_bridge: 发布控制消息
mqtt_bridge -> mqtt_broker: Publish control command
mqtt_broker -> device: 转发控制消息
device -> mqtt_broker: 执行命令并响应
mqtt_broker -> mqtt_bridge: 转发响应
mqtt_bridge -> api: 处理响应
api -> database: 更新设备状态
api -> web_app: 返回执行结果
web_app -> user: 显示执行结果

== 固件OTA更新流程 ==
user -> web_app: 触发OTA更新
web_app -> api: POST /devices/{id}/ota
api -> database: 查询固件信息
api -> api: 准备固件文件
api -> mqtt_bridge: 发布OTA消息
mqtt_bridge -> mqtt_broker: Publish OTA command
mqtt_broker -> device: 转发OTA消息
device -> mqtt_broker: 请求固件下载
mqtt_broker -> mqtt_bridge: 转发请求
mqtt_bridge -> api: 处理下载请求
api -> device: 发送固件数据 (MQTT)
device -> device: 验证并安装固件
device -> mqtt_broker: 发送更新状态
mqtt_broker -> mqtt_bridge: 转发状态
mqtt_bridge -> api: 处理状态更新
api -> database: 更新设备固件版本
api -> web_app: 推送更新状态
web_app -> user: 显示更新进度

@enduml

